{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "chatcmpl-tool-badf719fa726586c", "type": "tool_result", "content": "213:<li class=\"ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection\"><a href=\"#Sx5.SSx1\" title=\"In Results and Analysis ‣ Audio-Anchored Fusion of Multi-Ratio DiT Reconstruction Residuals for Cross-Domain Audio Deepfake Detection\" class=\"ltx_ref\"><span class=\"ltx_text ltx_ref_title\">Main Results and Comparison with Public Systems</span></a></li>\n274:[Omitted long matching line]\n321:<p id=\"Sx1.I1.i3.p1.1\" class=\"ltx_p\">We evaluate against a separately optimized WavLM–ResNet18 single-stream reference and report three-seed system-level comparisons between two residual-based designs under shared data, cache, auditory branch, objectives, and optimizer. The strongest repeated observation is that auxiliary supervision harms dynamic competitive fusion on ITW for all three seeds.</p>"}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "68a11c12-a238-4d1f-bf1c-758209c51167", "uuid": "c450611f-6a19-47c5-ac69-f64c3d66c1d8", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T06:42:51.148Z", "tool_use_result": {"mode": "content", "numFiles": 0, "filenames": [], "content": "213:<li class=\"ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection\"><a href=\"#Sx5.SSx1\" title=\"In Results and Analysis ‣ Audio-Anchored Fusion of Multi-Ratio DiT Reconstruction Residuals for Cross-Domain Audio Deepfake Detection\" class=\"ltx_ref\"><span class=\"ltx_text ltx_ref_title\">Main Results and Comparison with Public Systems</span></a></li>\n274:[Omitted long matching line]\n321:<p id=\"Sx1.I1.i3.p1.1\" class=\"ltx_p\">We evaluate against a separately optimized WavLM–ResNet18 single-stream reference and report three-seed system-level comparisons between two residual-based designs under shared data, cache, auditory branch, objectives, and optimizer. The strongest repeated observation is that auxiliary supervision harms dynamic competitive fusion on ITW for all three seeds.</p>", "numLines": 3}}
